{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 16","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the product <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/f/44f680ceef7905ec54da7fdf7bae4bdd9064b4f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(12)(15)(16)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />, each factor written in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, equals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/1/d71bf7c064771193c72a9fe4b0ed0db9c8996aca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3146$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"35\" height=\"13\" /> in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/4/cb40a991a3d71bcf3eab4dc65df62e3331f4f6a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s=12+15+16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"14\" />, each term expressed in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/7/f37bba504894945c07a32f5496d74299a37aa51c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, is \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/c/5dc1b83aded2b9bc6de06465bed43c0c0b48dedf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 43\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 44\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 45\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 46\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 47$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Converting everything into base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/4/f74d8cccd9701b0dc91eacf5e28df9814d7c0155.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b + 2)(b+5)(b+6) = 3b^3 + b^2 + 4b + 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"315\" height=\"19\" />.  Looking ahead, the constant term of the polynomial will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/7/3072749328cf22b195f5b401fd18736c78bd26a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2*5*6 -6 = 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"135\" height=\"13\" />. By the Rational Root Theorem, the only possible integer roots are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/5/285d4f6d676f94fdd39a494a045ed8cdb74a24bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, 6, 9, 18, 27, 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"156\" height=\"16\" />.  Bases <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/8/b3823ed30af499986e288085620b5d9805fef4b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1, 2, 3, 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" /> do not have a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as a digit.  Testing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/c/15cc8804d5482ae978d97e7912aa9c768329ad49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=9$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> gives a solution that works.\n</p><p>Therefore, we are working in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Adding the units place in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/2/6f204152db8b3cd68e473dbb6e9aa4452fd121ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 5 + 6 = 14_9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"120\" height=\"15\" />, so we carry the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> to get a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/8/228e8dd98384366ab219c5f8ca91d530c285ddf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$44_9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" />, which is option <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1967 AHSME Pro